ogy, so it is always much cooler here than in the surrounding desert. Masdar City Masdar City is a green oasis among the stone jungle. This sustainable development area is rapidly developing clean technology and a free economic zone. Masdar City stands at the crossroads of promising markets in the Middle East and Asia, so multinational companies operate here, for which proximity to Abu Dhabi International Airport is important. Here, within walking distance from each other, there are luxurious residential complexes, a variety of shops, restaurants and world-class medical facilities, and from the windows of offices overlooking green parks. Thanks to its convenient location, Masdar City offers easy access to the center of Abu Dhabi and nearby cities.","price":601932,"title":"The Gate","bitrix":{"id":842,"pf_id":"are.2.10636","source":null,"project_id":"The Gate","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Gate","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Reportage Properties","project_location":"Masdar City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/227/images/2023/6/9/340x252/xJF7O8LNwIYx86LPBfPxjwVw72uIJqgDKqUxtww4.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/227/images/2023/6/9/464x312/xJF7O8LNwIYx86LPBfPxjwVw72uIJqgDKqUxtww4.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":24.4372477,"lng":54.6154684},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/227/images/2023/6/9/340x252/VRJf43GPyIOrWqOc2ZR3liynm1rgiPzPcFANgEGW.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/227/images/2023/6/9/464x312/VRJf43GPyIOrWqOc2ZR3liynm1rgiPzPcFANgEGW.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/227/images/2023/6/9/340x252/J7Ns2ADpBtkaGo348whGElX2jOQpMInudPRvs6Iw.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/227/images/2023/6/9/464x312/J7Ns2ADpBtkaGo348whGElX2jOQpMInudPRvs6Iw.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan